<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>
  <!-- Special bodies (Core DefModExtension_SpecialBody: latent until the Convergence). Iron skin uses vanilla degree commonality. -->

  <TraitDef>
    <defName>CVG_Body_IronSkin</defName>
    <forcedPassions>
      <li>Melee</li>
    </forcedPassions>
    <commonality>0.25</commonality>
    <exclusionTags>
      <li>CVG_SpecialBody</li>
    </exclusionTags>
    <degreeDatas>
      <li>
        <degree>0</degree>
        <label>iron skin</label>
        <description>{PAWN_nameDef}'s skin is as hard as iron: blades skid off it. Nine Temperings disciples temper the body with bamboo rods and glacier rivers until the flesh forgets how to bruise. It hardens further with body tempering.</description>
        <commonality>1</commonality>
        <statOffsets>
          <ArmorRating_Sharp>0.06</ArmorRating_Sharp>
          <ArmorRating_Blunt>0.04</ArmorRating_Blunt>
        </statOffsets>
        <skillGains>
          <Melee>2</Melee>
        </skillGains>
      </li>
      <li>
        <degree>1</degree>
        <label>bronze skin</label>
        <description>{PAWN_nameDef}'s skin has the sheen and hardness of bronze, and turns aside cuts and blows alike. The Sect of Nine Temperings casts its guardian statues in that same color, to honor the disciples who reached this stage. It hardens further with body tempering.</description>
        <commonality>0.25</commonality>
        <statOffsets>
          <ArmorRating_Sharp>0.12</ArmorRating_Sharp>
          <ArmorRating_Blunt>0.08</ArmorRating_Blunt>
        </statOffsets>
        <skillGains>
          <Melee>2</Melee>
        </skillGains>
      </li>
      <li>
        <degree>2</degree>
        <label>ancestral iron skin</label>
        <description>An ancestral iron body: even bullets struggle to pierce {PAWN_nameDef}, and every wound runs shallower. Kongming, Guardian of the Nine Temperings, is said to have stopped a falling bronze bell with his bare back at this stage.</description>
        <commonality>0.03</commonality>
        <statOffsets>
          <ArmorRating_Sharp>0.2</ArmorRating_Sharp>
          <ArmorRating_Blunt>0.15</ArmorRating_Blunt>
        </statOffsets>
        <statFactors>
          <IncomingDamageFactor>0.85</IncomingDamageFactor>
        </statFactors>
        <skillGains>
          <Melee>2</Melee>
        </skillGains>
      </li>
    </degreeDatas>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="Convergence.DefModExtension_TraitConflicts">
        <conflicts>
          <li MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech"><trait>Delicate</trait></li>
          <li><trait>Wimp</trait></li>
          <li><trait>Immunity</trait><degree>-1</degree></li>
        </conflicts>
      </li>
      <li Class="Convergence.DefModExtension_TraitProgression">
        <counter>BodyTempering</counter>
        <steps>
          <li>
            <degree>1</degree>
            <threshold>120</threshold>
          </li>
          <li>
            <degree>2</degree>
            <threshold>480</threshold>
          </li>
        </steps>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </TraitDef>

  <TraitDef>
    <defName>CVG_Body_Saber</defName>
    <forcedPassions>
      <li>Melee</li>
    </forcedPassions>
    <commonality>0</commonality>
    <exclusionTags>
      <li>CVG_SpecialBody</li>
    </exclusionTags>
    <degreeDatas>
      <li>
        <label>saber body</label>
        <description>{PAWN_nameDef}'s body is a blade: blows land more often, cut deep, and sabers feel like part of the arm. Qing Feng split a mountain with one stroke before founding the Formless Sword Sect; the sword sages say his body was an edge long before his sword was.</description>
        <statOffsets>
          <MeleeHitChance>3</MeleeHitChance>
        </statOffsets>
        <statFactors>
          <MeleeDamageFactor>1.15</MeleeDamageFactor>
        </statFactors>
        <skillGains>
          <Melee>3</Melee>
        </skillGains>
      </li>
    </degreeDatas>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="Convergence.DefModExtension_TraitConflicts">
        <conflicts>
          <li><trait>Brawler</trait></li>
        </conflicts>
      </li>
      <li Class="Convergence.DefModExtension_SpecialBody">
        <chance>0.006</chance>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </TraitDef>

  <TraitDef>
    <defName>CVG_Body_Vajra</defName>
    <forcedPassions>
      <li>Melee</li>
    </forcedPassions>
    <commonality>0</commonality>
    <exclusionTags>
      <li>CVG_SpecialBody</li>
    </exclusionTags>
    <conflictingTraits><li>Tough</li></conflictingTraits>
    <degreeDatas>
      <li>
        <label>vajra body</label>
        <description>The indestructible vajra body: {PAWN_nameDef} barely feels pain and wounds go shallow. The first woman to reach it founded the Sect of Nine Temperings, whose twelve halls came through the Great Rupture without a single crack.</description>
        <statOffsets>
          <PainShockThreshold>0.5</PainShockThreshold>
        </statOffsets>
        <statFactors>
          <IncomingDamageFactor>0.7</IncomingDamageFactor>
        </statFactors>
        <skillGains>
          <Melee>3</Melee>
        </skillGains>
      </li>
    </degreeDatas>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="Convergence.DefModExtension_TraitConflicts">
        <conflicts>
          <li MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech"><trait>Delicate</trait></li>
          <li><trait>Wimp</trait></li>
          <li><trait>Immunity</trait><degree>-1</degree></li>
        </conflicts>
      </li>
      <li Class="Convergence.DefModExtension_SpecialBody">
        <chance>0.003</chance>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </TraitDef>

  <TraitDef>
    <defName>CVG_Body_IceBoneJade</defName>
    <commonality>0</commonality>
    <exclusionTags>
      <li>CVG_SpecialBody</li>
    </exclusionTags>
    <degreeDatas>
      <li>
        <label>ice bone, jade muscle</label>
        <description>Bones of ice and muscles of jade: {PAWN_nameDef} does not feel the cold, is strikingly beautiful and, once qi flows, cultivates fast. Shen Ruoxue, Sword Elder of the Formless Sword, was born with such a body, and her frost blades are said to be cut from her own breath.</description>
        <statOffsets>
          <ComfyTemperatureMin>-25</ComfyTemperatureMin>
          <PawnBeauty>2</PawnBeauty>
        </statOffsets>
        <statFactors>
          <CVG_CultivationSpeed>1.1</CVG_CultivationSpeed>
        </statFactors>
        <skillGains>
          <Intellectual>2</Intellectual>
        </skillGains>
      </li>
    </degreeDatas>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="Convergence.DefModExtension_SpecialBody">
        <chance>0.006</chance>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </TraitDef>

  <TraitDef>
    <defName>CVG_Body_Thunder</defName>
    <forcedPassions>
      <li>Shooting</li>
    </forcedPassions>
    <commonality>0</commonality>
    <exclusionTags>
      <li>CVG_SpecialBody</li>
    </exclusionTags>
    <degreeDatas>
      <li>
        <label>thunder body</label>
        <description>Lightning recognizes {PAWN_nameDef} as kin: heavenly tribulations strike softer, and fire bites less. Tales from Jiuxiao speak of children born during tribulation storms who later walked through their own lightning as if it were rain.</description>
        <statOffsets>
          <CVG_CelestialDissonance>-0.5</CVG_CelestialDissonance>
          <ArmorRating_Heat>0.15</ArmorRating_Heat>
        </statOffsets>
        <skillGains>
          <Shooting>3</Shooting>
        </skillGains>
      </li>
    </degreeDatas>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="Convergence.DefModExtension_SpecialBody">
        <chance>0.006</chance>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </TraitDef>

  <TraitDef>
    <defName>CVG_Body_TenThousandPoisons</defName>
    <forcedPassions>
      <li>Medicine</li>
    </forcedPassions>
    <commonality>0</commonality>
    <exclusionTags>
      <li>CVG_SpecialBody</li>
    </exclusionTags>
    <degreeDatas>
      <li>
        <label>ten thousand poisons body</label>
        <description>Poison is food to {PAWN_nameDef}: toxins and foul air barely harm this body, and remedies are known by taste. The Heavenly Cauldron Pavilion bids for the blood of such people at auction, since a single drop draws the poison out of a pill.</description>
        <statOffsets>
          <ToxicResistance>1.0</ToxicResistance>
          <ToxicEnvironmentResistance>0.8</ToxicEnvironmentResistance>
        </statOffsets>
        <skillGains>
          <Medicine>3</Medicine>
        </skillGains>
      </li>
    </degreeDatas>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="Convergence.DefModExtension_TraitConflicts">
        <conflicts>
          <li><trait>Immunity</trait><degree>-1</degree></li>
        </conflicts>
      </li>
      <li Class="Convergence.DefModExtension_SpecialBody">
        <chance>0.006</chance>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </TraitDef>

  <TraitDef>
    <defName>CVG_Body_BeastMarrow</defName>
    <forcedPassions>
      <li>Animals</li>
    </forcedPassions>
    <commonality>0</commonality>
    <exclusionTags>
      <li>CVG_SpecialBody</li>
    </exclusionTags>
    <degreeDatas>
      <li>
        <label>beast marrow</label>
        <description>Beast marrow in the bones: strength and healing of a beast, and an appetite to match. Old rogue hunters say it comes from an ancestor who ate the heart of a spirit beast, and that the beast is still hungry.</description>
        <statFactors>
          <MeleeDamageFactor>1.1</MeleeDamageFactor>
          <InjuryHealingFactor>1.3</InjuryHealingFactor>
        </statFactors>
        <hungerRateFactor>1.3</hungerRateFactor>
        <skillGains>
          <Animals>3</Animals>
        </skillGains>
      </li>
    </degreeDatas>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="Convergence.DefModExtension_TraitConflicts">
        <conflicts>
          <li MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech"><trait>Delicate</trait></li>
          <li><trait>Wimp</trait></li>
          <li><trait>Immunity</trait><degree>-1</degree></li>
        </conflicts>
      </li>
      <li Class="Convergence.DefModExtension_SpecialBody">
        <chance>0.015</chance>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </TraitDef>

</Defs>
